# Diagnostic renders. ANCHORED to the repository root with a leading slash, because the
# debug tools write them here and nowhere else. Unanchored, these match at any depth: the
# unanchored `land-*.png` silently swallowed a vendored Cesium asset
# (viewer/public/vendor/cesium/Assets/Textures/maki/land-use.png), and a 394-of-395 vendor
# would have committed clean and passed unnoticed. Keep the slashes.
/*.ppm
/plates.png
/margins.png
/motion.png
/land-*.png
/base.png
/tectonic.png
/macro.png
/harbour-*.png
/bottom*.png
/grid-*.png
/grid-*.ppm
/fine-*.png
/fine-*.ppm
/look-*.png
/look-*.ppm
/patch.*
/chartlook.*
/chart-*.png
/relief.png
/safety*.png

/target/
crates/*/target/
